    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Maths feels like a bridge between abstract ideas and real-world logic—something I can’t ignore but also struggle to fully grasp yet. It’s both intimidating and fascinating, especially since my parents’ education levels differ, leaving me in a middle ground where I’m curious but often feel unprepared. My love for physics makes it easier to see its practical applications, though the complexity still challenges me.",
