    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Not directly—I’m still in lower secondary—but if I had access, tools like step-by-step solvers (e.g., Wolfram Alpha) could help me visualize problems better. My high conscientiousness might push me to seek out such resources, though my low extraversion means I’d prefer structured guidance over chaotic searches.",
